      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Been expecting them to fix this for a while now and even after yet another update, its still not fixed.\nYou can find even more proof of this by simply checking your output log. Your client never ever bothers to even send a request to \"https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/auth/user/playermoderated\" to sync Player Moderations towards you.\nThe developers made changes to the moderation system without testing it properly(please stop doing that).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
