      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I can confirm this, it's fixed entirely. Thank you.\nThe fix has gone even further than I expected it would and corrected the old capsule bug as well. They're also not listed in the \"In Room\" part of the social menu anymore either.\nFor those of you who'd want to know if someone you have blocked or has blocked you is in the room, you need to select someone with the quick menu and cycle through everyone with the arrow buttons. Or alternatively use the debug gui.\nI think that's an acceptable change, so you only see them if you go out of your way to find them really.\nGlad it not only fixed the new bug but also a really old one. Thanks for listening ^^",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
